# Technical Design

## 1. Data Layer

The platform uses a relational database to store pharmacy
operational data including products, inventory, sales,
customers, suppliers and purchase orders.

## 2. Analytics Layer

Operational data is transformed into analytical metrics
for understanding sales, inventory movement, product
performance and cash flow.

## 3. Predictive Intelligence

Historical data can be used to identify inventory patterns,
reorder requirements and potential expiry risks.

## 4. AI Assistant

The AI assistant enables natural-language interaction
with pharmacy data through a controlled natural-language
to SQL pipeline.

## 5. Data Validation

Generated database queries are validated before execution
to prevent unsupported or unsafe operations.
